    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T20:28:34Z",
    "body": "Two side issues here to consider as well, which apply if we keep the removing steps:\n* #12098\n* we probably also need [moving steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#html-element-moving-steps) here.  (I suspect this is a case of two PRs being developed around the same time and the interaction between them being missed.)\n\nFor the issue here, I personally prefer @josepharhar's first option above, keeping all the `<selectedcontent>` elements up-to-date rather than just one.",
