    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T22:06:20Z",
    "body": "The cloning would be a change to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#update-a-select's-selectedcontent so that it iterates a list of `selectedcontent` rather than just updating one of them as it does today.  (The removing steps and parts of the post-connection steps are there to handle the case of insertions/removals changing *which* `<selectedcontent>` is the one that gets updated, and if we update all of them we can avoid dealing with insertions/removals changing the state of a *different* `<selectedcontent>`.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
