    "created_at": "2026-02-09T11:13:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-09T11:13:44Z",
    "body": "We currently manage `selectedcontent` disabled state as part of the post-connection steps. This means that if you insert multiple `selectedcontent` elements the first will calculate its disabled state and then trigger the `select` element to find `selectedcontent` element descendants to update. This will end up updating all `selectedcontent` elements descendants, even if they later end up being disabled.\n\nSo we probably need a new strategy for that too, even if it is an error condition.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3871096593/reactions",
