    "updated_at": "2026-02-25T18:19:37Z",
    "body": "I'm going to start implementing this in chromium behind a flag, and I'm going to update the selectedcontent WPTs in the process. If anyone would prefer for me to delay updating the WPTs, let me know and I will avoid doing so or revert changes.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3961133291/reactions",
